---

NOTE: This project is a clean-room reverse-engineering / research toolkit for
the Pure3D file format used by Radical Entertainment's games. It does not
include, and must never include, copyrighted game assets (models, textures,
audio, scripts) extracted from any commercial game. The `references/`
directory contains third-party open-source repositories used purely as
research material; each retains its own original license (see the LICENSE /
license.txt file inside each subdirectory). `samples/` must only ever contain
files that are safe to redistribute (freely licensed test files, synthetic
data, or files already published as open-source test fixtures by upstream
projects).
